  {:exercise/id "18B"
   :exercise/skill :translate
   :exercise/direction :to-english
   :exercise/dialog? false
   :exercise/instructions ""
   :exercise/hints ["playa = beach" "maestros = teachers"]
   :exercise/items
   [{:item/n 1
     :item/prompt ["¿Pueden escucharlo?"]
     :item/answer ["Can you (all) hear (listen to) him?*"]}
    {:item/n 2
     :item/prompt ["Con este método no pueden olvidar los verbos."]
     :item/answer ["With this method you (all) can’t forget the verbs."]}
    {:item/n 3
     :item/prompt ["¿Quieren ver nuestra casa?"]
     :item/answer ["Do you (all) want to see our house?"]}
    {:item/n 4
     :item/prompt ["Necesitan escuchar los CDs cada día."]
     :item/answer ["You (all) need to listen to the CDs every day."]}
    {:item/n 5
     :item/prompt ["¿Quieren encontrar un hotel ahora?"]
     :item/answer ["Do you (all) want to find a hotel now?"]}
    {:item/n 6
     :item/prompt ["¿Quieren ir a una fiesta en nuestra casa este fin de semana?"]
     :item/answer ["Do you (all) want to go to a party in our house this weekend."]}
    {:item/n 7
     :item/prompt ["¿Pueden escucharme por favor?"]
     :item/answer ["Can you (all) listen to me please?"]}
    {:item/n 8
     :item/prompt ["Es importante, necesitan escucharlo."]
     :item/answer ["It is important, you (all) need to listen to him."]}
    {:item/n 9
     :item/prompt ["¿Quieren ir con nosotros para conocer nuestros amigos mexicanos?"]
     :item/answer
     ["Do you (all) want to go with us in order to (know) meet our Mexican friends?"]}
    {:item/n 10
     :item/prompt
     ["Necesitamos rentar un coche. ¿Qué tipo de coche quieren? Queremos un coche grande."]
     :item/answer
     ["We need to rent a car. What type of car do you (all) want? We want a big car."]}
    {:item/n 11
     :item/prompt
     ["¿Qué documentación necesitamos para viajar en México? Necesitan visa y pasaporte."]
     :item/answer
     ["What documentation do we need to travel in Mexico? You (all) need a visa and passport."]}
    {:item/n 12
     :item/prompt
     ["Necesitan invitar al profesor a su fiesta. Pero no queremos. ¿Por qué no quieren invitarlo? Porque no nos gusta el profesor."]
     :item/answer
     ["You (all) need to invite the professor to your party. But we don't want (to). Why don't you (all) want to invite him? Because we don't like the professor."]}
    {:item/n 13
     :item/prompt
     ["¿Dónde quieren rentar este verano? Queremos rentar una casa en la Riviera Maya."]
     :item/answer
     ["Where do you (all) want to rent this summer? We want to rent a house on the Mayan Riviera."]}
    {:item/n 14
     :item/prompt ["¿Qué quieren hacer en verano? Queremos descansar en la playa."]
     :item/answer ["What do you (all) want to do in summer? We want to rest on the beach."]}
    {:item/n 15
     :item/prompt
     ["¿Quieren ir a un restaurante típico? Sí, nos gusta conocer la comida tradicional."]
     :item/answer
     ["Do you (all) want to go to a typical restaurant? Yes, we like to know the traditional food."]}
    {:item/n 16
     :item/prompt
     ["¿Quieren trabajar en México en verano? Sí, queremos trabajar como maestros de inglés."]
     :item/answer
     ["Do you (all) want to work in Mexico in summer? Yes, we want to work as teachers of English."]}
    {:item/n 17
     :item/prompt
     ["Pueden practicar español con nosotros. Sí, queremos practicar con ustedes."]
     :item/answer
     ["You (all) can practice Spanish with us? Yes, we want to practice with you (all)."]}
    {:item/n 18
     :item/prompt ["Necesitan aprender más español para hablar con nosotros."]
     :item/answer ["You (all) need to learn more Spanish in order to speak with us."]}
    {:item/n 19
     :item/prompt
     ["¿Quieren ir a México con nosotros en verano? Sí, queremos, pero no podemos,tenemos otros planes."]
     :item/answer
     ["Do you (all) want to go to Mexico with us in summer? Yes, we want to, but we can’t, we have other plans."]}
    {:item/n 20
     :item/prompt
     ["¿Cuándo necesitamos estar en el restaurante? Necesitan estar allá a las 8:00 p.m."]
     :item/answer
     ["When do we need to be in the restaurant? You (all) need to be there at 8:00 p.m. * The verb to hear in Spanish is oir. However, it is very common for Spanish speakers to use the verb escuchar when in English we would say to hear."]}]
